<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Register | EventHub</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body><main class="auth-wrap"><section class="auth-card"><div class="brand">✦ EventHub</div><p class="eyebrow">CREATE YOUR ACCOUNT</p><h1>Join EventHub</h1><p class="muted">Create an account to register for events.</p>
<% if (error) { %><div class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
<form action="/auth/register" method="post"><label>Full name<input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" placeholder="At least 8 characters" required></label><label>Confirm password<input name="confirmPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" placeholder="Repeat password" required></label><button type="submit">Create account →</button></form><p class="footnote">Already have an account? <a href="/auth/login">Sign in</a></p></section><aside class="hero"><span class="hero-pill">DISCOVER WHAT'S NEXT</span><h2>Find your community. Make every event count.</h2><p>Register once, then explore what's happening.</p><div class="hero-shapes">✳ &nbsp; ◉ &nbsp; ✦</div></aside></main></body></html>
